# src/apps/daemon/internal/networking/serverless

## Purpose
Integrates serverless relay or transport endpoints into the daemon networking stack.

## Contents
Contains Go client/configuration helpers for supported serverless networking backends and their request/response handling.

## Interfaces and dependencies
Consumed by networking/routing orchestration and depends on HTTP/TLS/network clients plus deployment/configuration contracts.

## Invariants
Remote responses are treated as untrusted, outbound destinations obey egress policy, requests are cancellable and bounded, and backend failures cannot silently become successful transport state.